VALUES (1010, 'Oasis Blend', 'Oasis Blend', 'Formulated for palm and date trees, Oasis Blend enriches soil with dairy compost, worm castings, and essential nutrients for healthy growth and fruit development, creating lush, thriving oases.', 'Amendment', 'PALM AND DATE TREE PLANT FOOD BLEND', 'Oasis Blend — Soil Seed & Water', 'Formulated for palm and date trees, Oasis Blend enriches soil with dairy compost, worm castings, and essential nutrients for healthy growth and fruit development, creating lush, thriving oases.', 'oasis, blend', 'Worm Castings,Magnesium Sulfate,Organic Dairy Compost', 'Landscapers,Organic Farmers,Fruit Growers,Date Tree,Ornamental Plans,Palm Tree', 'As a palm and date tree plant food blend, it can be mixed with existing soil. It is excellent for commercial and organic farmers, landscapers, gardeners, and nurseries.', 'Specifically formulated to retain moisture and improve soil aeration. It encourages robust plant growth, even in challenging conditions. Ideal for drought-prone areas, ensuring plants remain hydrated and healthy.', 'Dates have a long history, dating back to around 4000 B.C. when they were initially grown and domesticated in the Fertile Crescent between Egypt and Mesopotamia. Date palms are considered one of the human civilizations'' original founder plants and are from the grass family. They prefer hot and dry climates and will thrive in sandy, loamy, or even clay soil. At Soil Seed and Water, we developed our Oasis Mix to enrich the soil with essential nutrients, ensuring that date palm trees flourish. Unlike other blends, our Oasis blend provides a steady stream of vital nutrients, which is important throughout the early spring and late summer when the palms are actively growing. Date trees also need soil with good drainage, which is why we formulated our Oasis blend to have that goal in mind. Although dates are technically a stonefruit and our stonefruit blend is similar and could be used this blend is specific for dates.', 'Mix 1 part Oasis with 4 parts existing soil for new plantings of palm and date trees. For established trees, top-dress with 1/2" layer and gently work into the soil surface. Water thoroughly after application.', 'Pallet of 9 lb bags,Pallet of 1CF bags,2.2 CY Tote,Bulk Delivery', 'Oasis 9LB WB.jpg', 'Compost Texture Look.jpg', NULL, ARRAY['Pallet of 9 lb bags', 'Pallet of 1CF bags', '2.2 CY Tote', 'Bulk Delivery'], 0, 0, TRUE, 10, 'Formulated for palm and date trees, Oasis Blend enriches soil with dairy compost, worm castings, and essential nutrients for healthy growth and fruit development, creating lush, thriving oases.', 'Compost Texture Look.jpg', FALSE, 10, 'active')
